"{\"summary\": \"The find output lists many .go files under gotreesitter@v0.56.0/grammars, including a python subdirectory with python.go, python_test.go, and aggregate_parity_test.go, plus grammar_blobs/python.go and python_test.go, and runtime/python_external_lex_states_gen.go and python_reserved_words_gen.go. It also shows python_scanner.go and z_subset_scanner_register_python.go and z_subset_blob_embed_python.go at the grammars level. The output does not show file contents, so which file defines the Python grammar is not established by these lines alone.\", \"ranges\": [[349, 351], [1474, 1474], [1195, 1197], [822, 822], [1306, 1306]]}"